  "scope": "Pure Python Opus entropy and packet framing; full single-stream SILK/CELT/hybrid packet decoding, FEC/loss concealment, transitions/redundancy, gain, soft clipping, phase control and original Discord Decoder PCM integration. Original VoiceMixer/AudioPlayer/VoiceClient sends interoperable 48kHz stereo CELT CBR packets over qualified MLS/DAVE/RTP/UDP. VoiceReceiver records and replays real decoded PCM. The sender explicitly uses its CELT policies; SILK/hybrid/FEC audio encoding is not implemented.",
